Here's everything you need to build the AI-Powered Smart Support Backend project:

What Problem It Solves
Small businesses and startups get repetitive customer support queries — order status, pricing, policies, complaints. Hiring support staff is expensive. This backend automates responses using AI, handling common queries instantly without human intervention.

How It Works (Core Flow)

User sends a query via REST API
Backend fetches their past conversation from MongoDB (context)
Sends context + new query to OpenAI API
Gets AI response back
Saves updated conversation to MongoDB
Returns response to user


